      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_VOYAGER_SMILE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "경계 태세 필요. 전투준비.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "警戒態勢が必要。戦闘準備。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP2_7_UNIT_S_VOYAGER_SMILE_002.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 33,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_VOYAGER_ORACLE",
      "UnitMotion": "SERIOUS",
      "UnitPos": "POS4",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "폭력은 좋아하지 않지만…",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "暴力は好きじゃないけど…",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP2_7_UNIT_S_VOYAGER_ORACLE_020.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 34,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_VOYAGER_ORACLE",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "끝까지 귀찮게 군다면 상대해 줄 수밖에.",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "アタシの運命に立ちはだかるっていうなら、相手になってあげるしかないね。",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP2_7_UNIT_S_VOYAGER_ORACLE_021.wav"
    },
    {
      "Uid": 35,
      "WaitClick": true,
      "WaitTime": 0.0,
      "UnitStrId": "NKM_UNIT_NPC_VOYAGER_ORACLE",
      "UnitMotion": "ANGRY",
      "UnitTalk_KOR": "보여주지! 미래를 꿰뚫어 보는 자의 싸움을!",
      "UnitTalk_JPN": "見せてあげるわ！未来を見通す者の、戦いをね！",
      "TalkTime": 0.03,
      "TalkVoice": "MAIN_EP2_7_UNIT_S_VOYAGER_ORACLE_022.wav"
